WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Connect via NSP
Live NSP lab; connector installed. Credential entry and provisioning are omitted.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Review the generated profile
This lab disables API certificate verification; use trusted certificates in production.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Connect and select the topic
Use the generated Kafka profile; no cluster credentials are entered here.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Read recent notifications
A bounded read shows ten retained notifications from this lab.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Keep metadata with the event
Record topic, partition, offset and time alongside your interpretation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Disconnect when finished
Disconnect ends this client session; it does not delete notifications.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Reuse the saved profile
The profile and reusable NSP workflow remain for the next connection.
